        "id": "a-buffer-role",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-limitation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "A 缓存的定位",
        "markdown": "A 缓存（a-buffer）算法是深度缓存算法的延伸，深度缓存中的 $z$ 才表示深度。教材把它定位为一种反走样、区域平均的可见性检测方法，并指出 Lucasfilm 在曲面绘制系统 REYES（Renders Everything You Ever Saw）中成功实现了该算法。该过程使用的缓存区域称为累积缓存（accumulation buffer），因为它除了深度值外还用于存储各种表面数据。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000503"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "A 缓存算法"
              ],
              "lineStart": 13724,
              "lineEnd": 13759,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0005/images/804427da96735f2543646415394f45999c6f5f9b1d3b7f3c38664945569c174f.jpg",
